B.Z5=s(["According to the report, users increased from last year.","The report will be used next year.","Users said the report increased."],t.s)
B.a62=new A.dr("news_summary","Summarise a news report","News and Society","I can identify the main point and key evidence in a short report.",B.kX,B.ayy,"\u5831\u9053\u306b\u3088\u308b\u3068\u3001\u5229\u7528\u8005\u306f\u53bb\u5e74\u3088\u308a\u5897\u3048\u305f\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u3002","Houdou ni yoru to, riyousha wa kyonen yori fueta to iu koto desu.","According to the report, the number of users increased from last year.",B.Z5,0,"\u306b\u3088\u308b\u3068 identifies the source and helps separate reported information from your own claim.","Radio corner","\ud83d\udcfb","opinion_reason")
B.XJ=s([u.d,"I have already checked it.","It does not need checking."],t.s)
B.a64=new A.dr("formal_request","Make a formal request","Professional Japanese","I can make a tactful request in a formal workplace setting.",B.kX,B.FB,"\u3054\u78ba\u8a8d\u3044\u305f\u3060\u3051\u307e\u3059\u3068\u5e78\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002","Gokakunin itadakemasu to saiwai desu.",u.d,B.XJ,0,"This formal pattern is common in professional email. Plain \u304a\u9858\u3044\u3057\u307e\u3059 is better in many everyday situations.","Letter set","\u2709\ufe0f","news_summary")
B.ZI=s([u.B,"The schedule became difficult the following week.","Which week did you schedule?"],t.s)
B.a60=new A.dr("negotiate_solution","Negotiate a practical solution","Professional Japanese","I can clarify a constraint and propose a workable alternative.",B.kX,B.eh,"\u305d\u306e\u65e5\u7a0b\u306f\u96e3\u3057\u3044\u305f\u3081\u3001\u7fcc\u9031\u3067\u306f\u3044\u304b\u304c\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304b\u3002","Sono nittei wa muzukashii tame, yokushuu de wa ikaga deshou ka?",u.B,B.ZI,0,"Stating a reason and offering an alternative makes a refusal constructive.","Meeting nook","\ud83e\udd1d","formal_request")
